-- 1364: Blog post -- "Agentic AI for TikTok Marketing: Keeping Up With a Platform That Rewards Volume".
-- Focus: agents across the TikTok loop -- trend discovery, hooks, scripts, captions, scheduling,
-- analysis -- plus why the platform rewards volume and where brand voice must stay human.
-- Funnels to WSQ Agentic AI for TikTok Marketing (TGS-2023036657), SG-only.
-- Published live (status=1), BACK-DATED to 2025-08-07 per the admin's "date all the digital
-- marketing blogs in Apr to Aug 2025" (post 14 of 16, WSQ/CASL digital marketing batch).
--
